{
  "_comment": "Per-station counting rules that differ from the workbook derivation in stations.json. This file wins over stations.json and survives an extract_config.py regen. Ultra Debriefs holds two job types in one table (Service = 'Ultra Cleaning' or 'Shroud Cleaning'); the workbook's Ultra COUNTIFS filtered on Location only, so shroud jobs were double-counted as Ultras. Every Ultra count below filters Service explicitly. Stations with hours_from_first_debrief only count labor from their first real debrief onward - earlier hours are implementation and training for a contract that had not started yet (JSX went live 8/1; BNA AA ramped similarly).",
